{"beat_id": "S018_B146", "speaker_id": "ivory_adjudicator", "text": "I cannot while seizure is contested.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "S018_B024 — The review loop", "source_speaker_label": "IVORY ADJUDICATOR"}},
{"beat_id": "S018_B147", "speaker_id": "cyanis", "text": "So we can't prove the order is false until you seize the Card.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "S018_B024 — The review loop", "source_speaker_label": "CYANIS"}},
{"beat_id": "S018_B148", "speaker_id": "ivory_adjudicator", "text": "Under current procedure—", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "S018_B024 — The review loop", "source_speaker_label": "IVORY ADJUDICATOR"}},
{"beat_id": "S018_B149", "speaker_id": "cyanis", "text": "And once you seize it, we're obeying the order we're trying to prove is false.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "S018_B024 — The review loop", "source_speaker_label": "CYANIS"}},
{"beat_id": "S018_B150", "speaker_id": "torren", "text": "That's fucked.", "left": {}, "right": {}, "active_side": "none", "advance_mode": "manual", "cues": {"pause_ms": 80, "interrupt": false, "implementation_flags": ["IN_WORLD_DIALOGUE"], "source_section": "S018_B024 — The review loop", "source_speaker_label": "TORREN"}},
